ro annaga','Clear error messages'=>'Tirtir fariimaha khaladaadka','Usage and cost log'=>'Isticmaalka iyo diiwaanka kharashka','Per-role AI permissions'=>'Ogolaanshaha AI ee qof walba leh doorka','One key, both plugins'=>'Hal furaha, labada qaybood ee dheeraadka ah','Modern admin screens'=>'Maamulka casriga ah ee shaashadaha','Setup wizard'=>'Saaxadda dejinta','Built-in help'=>'Caawinta ku dhex-taalla','Cross-promotion between the two plugins'=>'Iskutusiinta labada qalab ee dheeriga ah (plugins) dhexdooda','Zinn Digital® hosting promotion'=>'Horumarinta kaydinta Zinn Digital®','Pro licensing through Freemius (latest SDK)'=>'Sannad-sharciga Pro oo la sii marayo Freemius (SDK-gii ugu dambeeyay)','Free trial of Pro'=>'Imtixaanka bilaashka ah ee Pro','Bundle: Page Builder Sandwich Pro + Tranzly Pro'=>'Xirmadda: Page Builder Sandwich Pro + Tranzly Pro','Credited to Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Waxaa iska leh Zinn Digital® Ltd','Synced to GitHub like our other plugins'=>'GitHub sida plugin-yadayada kale ayaa loola midaysiiyey','Manual edits are protected'=>'Wax ka beddelka gacanta waa la ilaaliyaa','Failed translation report'=>'Warbixinta turjumaadda ee guuldarraysatay','Edit any translation easily'=>'Si sahlan u beddel turjumaad kasta','Do-not-translate list in the free version'=>'Liiska aan la turjumin ee nooca bilaashka ah','WooCommerce multi-currency'=>'WooCommerce lacagaha badan','AI quality check'=>'Hubinta tayada AI','Show content only in some languages'=>'Tus nuxurka kaliya luuqadaha qaar','Multilingual SEO audit'=>'Wixitaanka SEO ee luuqadaha badan','Translate forms'=>'Turjum foomamka','Translate comments and reviews'=>'Turjum faallooyinka iyo dib-u-eegisyada','Different images per language'=>'Sawirro kala duwan luqad kasta','Monthly spend cap per engine'=>'Xadka kharashka bilaha ah ee matalkiikiiba','Multilingual site search'=>'Raadinta goobta luqadaha badan','Speed promise, tested'=>'Ballanqaadka xawaaraha, la tijaabiyay','Multisite support'=>'Taageerada goobaha badan',