ce.'=>'PBN.ltd waa madalkayaga loogu talagalay martigelinta iyo maamulidda bogag badan oo hal mar ah.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Booqo PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Ka hel Page Builder Sandwich Pro iyo Tranzly Pro wadajir','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Xirmaddani waxay ka jaban tahay iibsashada labada boorso (plugin) midkiiba si gaar ah, iyada oo la raacayo qorshayaasha iyo xadka goobta isku midka ah.','See the bundle'=>'Eeg xirmada','Get %s'=>'Hel %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Isdhexgalku waa shaqaynayaa: %1$s iyo %2$s wada jir ayay u shaqaynayaan','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s waa uu ka shaqaynayaa boggan, marka labada furinba waxay wadaagaan hal kombuyuutar oo furaheyaal bixiye AI ah iyo hal shaashad oo habayn ah oo loogu talagalay iyaga.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Ku turjun boggan adigoo isticmaalaya Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich adiga oo si muuqaal ah u dhis bogag','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, oo ka socota Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Daabac bog kasta oo ku qoran luqado badan, adoo adeegsanaya cinwaanno la turjumay, xogta SEO iyo beddelaha luqadda. Wuxuu la shaqeeyaa bogagga aad halkan ku dhiseyso.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Bogagga si toos ah ugu naqshadee tifaftiraha adigoo isticmaalaya baloogyo xawaare sare leh oo aan lahayn raad raac. Wax kasta oo aad dhisato waxaa lagu turjumi karaa Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s waxa sameeyay isla kooxda waxayna si wadajir ah ula shaqeysaa qabsalkan (plugin).','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Marka hore oggolow in goobtan la xiro.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Geli ciwaan iimayl sax ah.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Markab ahaan ha oggolaan in hore loo soo diro macluumaadka taageerada.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Qor mawduuc iyo farriin.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Geli ciwaanka iimaylka ee ay taageeradu kuugu soo jawaabi karto.','Temporary support access created by the site owner. It is deleted automatically when it expires.'=>'Helitaanka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah ee uu abuuray mulkiilaha boggu. Si otomaatig ah ayaa loo tirtiraa marka uu dhaco.','Choose 1, 3 or 7 days.'=>'Dooro 1, 3 ama 7 maalmood.','Only a site administrator, signed in to this screen, can create temporary support access.'=>'Kaliya maamulaha goobta, ee soo galay shaashaddan, ayaa abuuri kara gelitaanka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah.','A unique user name could not be chosen. Try again.'=>'Lama dooran karo magaca isticmaale ee gaarka ah. Isku day mar kale.','Zinn Digital® support (temporary)'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® (ku-me-gaar ah)','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Helitaanka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah waa ay dhacday.','AI providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Sameeyayaasha ChatGPT. Qalab guud oo wanaagsan.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Sameeyeyaasha Claude. Ku xooggan qorista iyo sababaynta taxaddarka leh.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Moodellada Gemini ee Google. Degdeg ah oo jaban.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Shirkad AI oo Yurub ah oo leh moodallo degdeg ah oo jaban.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Qaabab jaban oo ku wanaagsan qorista iyo koodhka.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Hal furaha oo loogu talagalay moodooyinka ka kala yimid bixiyeyaal badan.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Adeeg kasta oo u shaqeeya sida OpenAI\'s API, oo ay ku jirto nooc ka shaqaynaya kombuyuutarkaaga ama adeerahaaga.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Guud ahaan (la isticmaalo marka aan wax gaar ah la cayimin)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Qorista iyo dib-u-qorista','Translation'=>'Turjumaad','Code and CSS'=>'Koodhka iyo CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, looma oggola inaad gasho boggan.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Goobahaan waxaa wadaagaya dhammaan qalabka (plugin) ee isticmaala: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Furayaashaada waxaa lagu kaydiyay xog-ururinta boggan waxaana loo diraa oo keliya bixiyaha aad dooratay — weligood annogu nooma soo diraan.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Tallaabada 1 ee 2: dooro bixiye AI ah','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Waxaad keeneysaa furahaaga, markaas waxaad si toos ah uga bixisaa bixiyaha wixii aad isticmaasho. Ma hubtid? Mid kasta oo ka mid ah kuwan ayaa si fiican u shaqeeya; waxaad ku dari kartaa kuwo kale hadhow.','Next'=>'Xiga','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Tallaabada 2 ee 2: ku xidh %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Geli cinwaanka adeeggaaga OpenAI-compatible, oo ku dhammaanaya /v1. Muhiimad lama siiyo furaha illaa adeeggu uu mid dalbado mooyaane.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Furo %s oo gala (ama samee akoon bilaash ah).','the %s API keys page'=>'bogga furayaasha API ee %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Samee furaha cusub oo koobi garee.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Halkan ku dheji oo riix "Keydi oo tijaabi". Waxaan direynaa hal codsi yar si aan u hubino in uu shaqeynayo.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Int aksaar ah waxay u baahan yihiin xoogaa deyn ah oo ku jirta akoonka ka hor intaysan furuhu shaqayn: %s.','add credit'=>'ku dar deyn','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Dooro bixiye kale','Address'=>'Cinwaanka','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Furaha la kaydiyay wuxuu ku dhammaanayaa …%s — dhejiso mid cusub si aad u beddesho','Key (optional)'=>'Furaha (ikhtiyaari)','API key'=>'Furaha API','Save and test'=>'Kaydi oo tijaabi','Providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha','Provider'=>'Bixiyaha','Status'=>'Xaaladda','Key'=>'Furaha','Get a key'=>'Key ka hel','Test'=>'Tijaabi','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Waxaa kaydiyay nooc cusub oo ah plugin: cusboonaysii plugin-kan, ama geli furaha mar labaad.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Furaha la kaydiyay mar dambe lama furi karo (furayaasha amniga ee boggu waa is beddeleen). Dib u geli.','Not connected'=>'Lama xiriirin','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ku xiran — imtixaankii ugu dambeeyay wuu guuleystay %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Imtixaankii ugu dambeeyay wuu guuldarraystay: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ku xidhan — wali lama tijaabin','Which model to use'=>'Noocyadee la isticmaalayaa','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ waxay calaamadeysaa taladeena hawshaas. Liiska waxaa ku jira dhammaan noocyada uu furahaagu isticmaali karo, kuwaas oo si toos ah looga aqriyay bixiyaha.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Lagetaliyey bixiyaha —','Save models'=>'Kaydi moodellada','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Ka cusbooneysii liiska moodelada bixiyeyaasha','Images'=>'Sawirrada','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Ku xidh OpenAI ama Google Gemini si aad sawiro u samayso.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka sawirka ee ugu dambeeyay ee bixiyaha ugu horreeya ee xiran —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Goobta raadinta (embeddings)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter si aad u dhisto tusmada raadinta ee boggaaga.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Nooca embedding-ka cusub ee bixiyaha ugu horreeya ee xiran —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Beddelidani waxay dib u dhisaysaa tusmada raadinta ee plugin kasta oo adeegsada.','best quality'=>'tayada ugu fiican','lowest cost'=>'kharashka ugu hooseeya','fastest'=>'ugu dhaqso badan','Add a model yourself'=>'Naftaada ku dar qaab','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Qaab cusub ayaa soo baxay maanta? Ku dheji magaciisa saxda ah si aad si toos ah u isticmaasho.','Model name'=>'Magaca qaabka','Add model'=>'Ku dar qaabka','Recommended models list'=>'Liiska moodellada lagu talinayo','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Liiska moodeellada lagu talinayo lama xaqiijin karo, markaa lama tusayo wax talo soo jeedin ah. Dib ugu rakib furaha (plugin), ama daar cusboonaysiinta maalinlaha ah ee hoose.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Liiska la isticmaalayo waxaa la daabacay %s. Cusboonaysiin kasta oo plugin ah waxay keentaa mid cusub.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Sidoo kale hubi Zinn Digital® hal mar maalintii si aad u hesho liis cusboonaysiiyey.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Kaliya codsi dejisan oo fudud ayaa la dirayaa: ma jiro fure, ma jiro ciwaan degel ah, wax walba oo ku saabsan nuxurkaaga ma jiraan. Liiska waa la saxiixay, liiska ku guuldareysta hubinta saxiixana waa la iska indhatirayaa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Markii ugu dambeysay ee la hubiyay %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Keydi, kadibna hubi hadda haddii la shiday','a newer list was installed'=>'liis ka cusub ayaa la rakibay','already up to date'=>'hore ula jaanqaaday','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'soo dejinta ayaa ku guuldareysatay hubinta saxiixa waana la iska indhatiray','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® lama gaari karin; liiska hadda jira waa in la isticmaalo','turned off'=>'damacsan','Open'=>'Furo','Check their status page'=>'Hubi boggooda xaaladda','Open your billing page'=>'Fur boggaaga biilasha','Open your API keys page'=>'Fur bogtaada API keys','Open the AI settings'=>'Fur goobaha AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looma oggola inaad taas sameyso.','Unknown provider.'=>'Bixiye aan la aqoon.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Geli cinwaanka adeegaga, tusaale ahaan http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Taasi uma eka furaha API. Nuqul ka yeeg mar kale, adiga oo aan wadata meelo bannaan.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Marka hore dheji furahaaga API.','Key removed.'=>'Furaha waa la saaray.','Models saved.'=>'Qaababka waa la keydiyay.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Geli magaca saxda ah ee moodalka, tusaale ahaan sida dukumentiyada bixiyuhu u qoreen.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'Waxaa lagu daray %s. Ka dooro hoosta "Waa maxay moodeelka la isticmaalayo".','Model removed.'=>'Qaabka waa la saaray.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Cusboonaysiinada maalinlaha ah waa damisanyihiin. Liiska la socda hordhacu (plugin) waa la isticmaalayaa.','Checked: %s.'=>'La hubiyay: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Liisaska moodalka waa la cusboonaysiiyay.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Furahaaga AI waxaa keydiyay nuqul ka cusub mid ka mid ah qalabkaaga dheeraadka ah (plugins). Cusboonaysii qalabkan, ama mar labaad geli furaha goobaha AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Furahaaga AI ee la keydiyay dib looma furan karo (furayaasha amniga ee boggu waa is beddeleen). Dib u geli dejinta AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI-gu wali lama habayn. Ku dar furaha bixiyaha AI dejinta AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hawushan ma jiro nooc la doortay. Ka dooro mid ka mid ah dejinta AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gaas laguma taageero noocaan ah ee qalab-kordhiinta.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro wax bixiyaha AI ah oo sawirro samayn kara oo ku xiran. Ku dar furaha OpenAI ama Google Gemini dejinta AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gan ma sameyn karo sawirro. Dooro OpenAI ama Google Gemini sawirrada ku jira dejinta AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo wax nooca sawir ah. Ka hubi fasaxyada furaha bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale oo sawirrada ah.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro bixiye AI ah oo ku xiran oo dhisli kara tusmada raadinta. Ku dar furaha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter goobaha AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo nooc kasta oo embedding model ah. Hubi ogolaanshaha furaha ee bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale si aad u baarto mareegta.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gan ma dhisi karo tusmada raadinta. Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama adeeg ku habboon raadinta bogga.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Goobtan ma gaari karto adeeggaaga AI. Hubi inuu shaqeynayo iyo in ciwaankiisa laga heli karo server-kaaga shabakadda (adeeg ka soocan kombuyuutarkaaga lagama heli karo goob la martigeliyay).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Boggan ma gaari karo %s. Hubi boggooda xaaladda; haddii ay shaqeynayaan, waxaa laga yaabaa in martigeliyahaagu xirayo xiriirada baxaya, ama ciwaanku waa khalad.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s waxay leedahay koontadaadu wax deyn ah ama saami ah oo hartay ma leh. Ku dar deyn ama kor u qaad xadkaaga koontadaada iyaga, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s ma aysan aqbalin furahaaga. Waxaa laga yaabaa in si khaldan loo qoray, la baabi\'iyay ama uu dhacay. Abuur fure cusub oo ku dheji halkan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s wuu diiday codsigan furahaaga. Furaha waxaa laga yaabaa inuusan heli karin qaabkan ama muuqaalkan, ama akoonkaaga ayaa u baahan in la xaqiijiyo.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Model-ka "%1$s" waxaa laga heli karo %2$s furehaaga. Dooro model kale oo ku jira dejinta AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Qorshahaaga %2$s kuma jiro tusaalaha "%1$s". Dooro tusaale kale oo ku jira dejinta AI, ama ku cusboonaysii qorshahaaga iyaga.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s wuxuu xaddidayaa inta uu fureyhu si dhakhso ah u diri karo codsiyada. Sug daqiiqad oo dib u day, ama kor u qaad xadkaaga sicirka iyaga.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s waxay la kulmeysaa dhibaatooyin hadda (cillad ama culays xad-dhaaf ah dhinaceeda). Wax khaldan kama jiraan habayntaada. Dib u day dhowaan.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Codsiga AI wuu fashilmay sabab aanan garan karin. Isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii dhacdo, la xiriir taageerada oo u dir macluumaadka hoose.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Bixiyaha AI wuxuu ku jawaabay qaab uusan fiilankani akhrin karin. Mar kale isku day; haddii ay sii socoto, dooro qaab kale ama la xiriir taageerada.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Caadi ah (OpenAI-compatible)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Marka hore keydso furaha bixiyahan.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Furanahaagu wuu shaqaynayaa, laakiin bixiyuhu ma liis-gareeyay qaab qoraal ah (text model) oo loogu talagalay. Ku dar qaab adigu hoose.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ku xidhan. %1$s wuxuu ku jawaabay iyadoo la adeegsanayo %2$s. Astaamahaaga AI waa diyaar in la isticmaalo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Dooxada isticmaalahaaga laguma oggola inay isticmaasho AI goobtan. Weydii maamule.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Goobtan waxay gaartay xadka kharashka AI ee bishan. Maamulaha ayaa kordhin kara goobaha AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Boggan wuxuu gaadhay xadka uu bishii isticmaali jiray codsiyada AI. Maamulaha ayaa kordhin kara goobaha AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Isticmaalka iyo kharashka','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Diiwaanka, xadka iyo ogolaanshaha doorka waxaa lagu dabaqaa sirdoonka macmalka (AI) ee lagu isticmaalo iyada oo loo sii marayo: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Qiimaha waa kuwo qiyaas ah, oo laga soo saaray qiimaha la daabacay; qaab aan la aqoon qiimihiisa waxaa loo tirinayaa eber.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Bishan: %1$s codsiyo, ku dhawaad %2$s.','When'=>'Goortay','Who'=>'Kuma','Used for'=>'Loogu talagalay','Model'=>'Qaabka','Tokens in / out'=>'Calaamadaha soo / baxay','About'=>'Ku saabsan','Result'=>'Natiijo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Weli lama samayn wax codsiyo AI ah.','Done'=>'La dhammeeyey','Limits and permissions'=>'Xadka iyo oggolaanshaha','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Xadka kharashka bisha (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'U daa madhan xad la\'aan. AI waxay istaagaysaa inta ka dhiman bisha marka kharashka qiyaasiga ahi uu gaaro heerkaas.','Monthly request limit'=>'Xadka codsiga bishii','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'U dhaaf faaruq xadka aan la koobnayn.','Who may use AI'=>'Ciddii isticmaali karta AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Calan ha saarin wax si aad ugu oggolaato qof kasta oo isticmaali kara sifooyinka furaha (plugin) inuu isticmaalo AI. Maamulayaashu waxay isticmaali karaan mar walba.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Kaydi xadka iyo ogolaanshaha','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Xadka iyo fasaxyada waa la keydiyay.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Luqaddaasi ma aha mid ka mid ah luqadaha boggan.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Turjumaaddu waa inay noqotaa nooca la mid ah nuxurka asalka ah.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Dooro mid ka mid ah luqadaha kale ee mareegta.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Qoraalka maamulaha ee barnaamijkan ku dhex jira (script-yada) ayaa ka maqan nuqulkan. Fadlan dib ugu rakib xirmo rasmi ah.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Shaarkani wuxuu u baahan yahay JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Dooro luuqad','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Macaamiisha martigelinta? Hel %1$d%% dhimis ah %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Ahaan macmiil martigelinta ee Zinn Digital®, waxaad heleysaa kood shaqsiyeed oo ah %d%% dhimis ah bixintaada ugu horreysa. Cusboonaysiinta waxaa lagu bixiyaa qiimaha caadiga ah.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Hel %d%% code-kayga oo tag bixinta lacagta','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Sicir-dhimistan waxaa loogu talagalay macaamiisha haysta qorshe martigelin lacag ah oo xaaladdisu wanaagsan tahay. Tijaabooyinka bilaashka ah uma qalmaan.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Waxaad horey u isticmaashay qiimo-dhimistaada macaamiisha martigelinta ee qalabkan.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hadda ma aan helin koodkaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado gudahood.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Horgalku waa inay noqotaa 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yar ama nambaro ah, ku billowda xaraf, mana aha inay magac ka dhigto qalabka la rakibo.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" ma aha koodh luqadeed. Isticmaal goobta WordPress ah sida fr_FR ama de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Liis garee ugu yaraan hal luqad.','Translations'=>'Turjubaanada','Edit the %s version'=>'Wax ka beddel nooca %s','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'Is barbar dhig nooca %s isku mid ah','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'Qoraalka beddelka ah','Caption'=>'Qoraalka hoose','Title'=>'Ciwaan','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'Luqad kasta u dooro mid ka mid ah liisaskaaga.','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Markabkan horta kaydi, kadibna halkan ku turjun.','This one'=>'Midan kan','Edit'=>'Wax ka beddel','Side by side'=>'Isbarbar dhig','Translate again'=>'Tarjumi markale','Translate'=>'Turjum','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'Abuur nuqul si gacan loogu turjumo','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'Turjumaaduhu waxay isticmaalaan matoorada loo qoondeeyay luqaddaas. Nooc qof tiro beelay ama wax ka beddelay marna lama dul-qoro.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Ma ogolidid inaad tarjunto shaygan.','%s: translated.'=>'%s: la turjumay.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'Tani ma aha turjumaad, markaasay jirin wax la ilaaliyo.','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'Noocan oo kale ah ee ku jira lama turjumin.','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'Qoraalka %s mar dambe kuma yaallo boggan. Dib u rar bogga.','No translation engine could take this text.'=>'Ma jiro mishiinka turjumaadaha ee qaadan kara qoraalkan.','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'Xulo mid ka mid ah luqadahaaga kale.','Compare translation'=>'Isku day turjumaadda','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'Ma ogolidid inaad wax ka beddesho turjumaaddan.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'Kani maaha turjumaad, markaas ma jiro wax la barbar-dhigo.','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'Asalka turjumaaddan hadda ma jiro.','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'Qeybta %s mar dambe ma aha qayb ka mid ah turjumaaddan. Dib u rar bogga oo mar kale isku day.','Translate on this page'=>'Turjubaan boggan','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Badeecaddan ayaa horey u lahayd nooc ku qoran luqaddaas.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Mashiinka turjumaadahaas lagama heli karo boggan.','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Matoorada kala duwan ee luuqad kasta, dib-u-noqoshada otomaatiga ah iyo xadka kharashka waa astaamo Tranzly Pro ah.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Luqad kasta waa inay noqotaa mid ka mid ah luqadaha mareegta, iyada oo mashiin la heli karo uu jiro.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Liiska gurmadka wuxuu magacaabi karaa oo keliya matoorada la heli karo.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Xaddiga bilaha ah waa lacag ku jirta US dollars, oo ah eber ama ka badan, oo loogu talagalay matoor la heli karo.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Turjubaanada la doorbido iyo codka luuqad kasta waa sifooyin Tranzly Pro ah. Liiska aan la turjumin waa bilaash.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Gelitaanada qaamuuska waa in lagu soo koobaa mid ka mid ah luqadaha mareegta.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Qaabka waxa loo dejiyaa iyadoo la raacayo luqadda bogga: heerka caadiga ah ee rasmi ahaanshaha, in ka badan ama ka yar, oo lagu daray tilmaamo ikhtiyaari ah.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Qiimaha %s maaha mid ka mid ah fursadaha la oggol yahay.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Safafka asbeegga looma heli karo boggan.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Shaqada turjumaaddu waxay u shaqeysaa sidii qofka bilaabaya, markaa isticmaaluhu waa inuu saxiixaa.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Ma jirto wax aad u oggolaaday inaad ku turjunto xulashadaas.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Shyraadku ma aha qayb ka mid ah shaqo turjumaad ah.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Adigu uma oggolidhidh inaad beddesho turjumaaddaas.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Kooxda shaygan waxay horey u leedahay nooca %1$s (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Hanti la mid ah ma noqon karto turjumaaddeeda.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Sheygaas waa horay turjumaad shay kale. Marka hore iska fur isku xidhkiisa.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Xiriirinta turjumaadda lama keydinin.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Qoraalkaas lama turjumi karo halkan.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Qoraalkaas warbaahinta ah laguma turjumi karo halkan.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Turjumaad waxaa la daabici karaa ama loo hayn karaa sidii qabyo.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Lama oggola inaad daabacdo noocyadan oo kale ah.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Bixitaankani waa mid horay loogu qoray luqaddaas.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Turjumaaddan waxaa tafatiray qof (ama waa la soo dejiyay), markaa waa la ilaaliyay. Fur si aad mar labaad u turjunto.','That item does not exist.'=>'Buytaasu ma jiro.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Midnaaba turjumaad ah lama dejinin weli. Ku dar furaha mid ka mid ah Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Mashiinka tarjumaaddu wali lama habeyn: marka hore ku dar furaha uu leeyahay.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Qoraalkan oo kale ayaa hadda turjumaya shaqo kale; shaygani wuxuu isticmaali doonaa jawaabtaas.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Ma jiro mishiinka turjumaadaha ee qaadan kara shaygan.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Mashiinku ma uusan soo celin turjumaad qayb kasta oo ka mid ah shaygan. Wax isbeddel ah lama samayn.','AI model'=>'Qaabka AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Nooca AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s wuxuu la kulmayaa dhibaatooyin hadda. Isku day mar dambe, ama isticmaal matoor kale.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Boggaagu wuxuu gaari waayay %s. Hubi inuu sameyn karo xiriiryo baxaya, dabadeedna mar kale isku day.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s ma aysan aqbalin furahaaga API. Ka hubi furaha Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Akoonkaaga %s wuxuu isticmaalay saami-qeybsigiisa ama hadhaagiisa. Ku shubo iyaga, ama isticmaal matoor kale.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s waxay nicmeysay inaan gaabinno. Si otomaatig ah ayaa mar labaad loo dayn doonaa.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Qoraalkan waa mid aad u dheer %s hal mar. Qeybi nuxurka, ama isticmaal matoor kale.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s wuu diiday inuu turjumo nuxurkan. Isku day matoor kale, ama gacanta ku turjumo.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s ma turjumayo luqaddan. Dooro mishiil kale oo loogu talagalay.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'Xadka kharashka ee bishan ee %s waa la gaaray, markaa wax kale looma dirin. Kordhi xadka Tranzly → Engines, ama sug illaa bisha xigta.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Turjumaadda lagu sameeyay %s way fashilantay sabab Tranzly aanu aqoonsan karin. Hoos ka eeg faahfaahin.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Aqoonsiga matoorisku waa inay noqdaan xarfo yaryar, tirooyin, iyo xarfo kala-gooyo ah.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'furaha ruqsadda','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Isticmaale weli lama xiriirin shatiga, taas oo lagama maarmaan u ah in laga hortago hawlgelinta aan la oggolayn. Si aad shatiga ugu abuurto isticmaalahaaga, waxaad ogolaatay inaad wadaagto magaca buuxa ee isticmaalahaaga WordPress iyo cinwaanka iimaylka.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'goobaha la soo sheegay','Account'=>'Koontada','Account Details'=>'Tafaasiisha Koontada','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Koontadu waxay sugeysaa in la hawlgeliyo. Fadlan hubi iimaylkaaga oo guji xiriiriyaha si aad u hawlgeliso koontadaada ka dibna mar kale soo gudbi foomka wakiilka.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad ku darto %1$s gudaha %2$s?','Actions'=>'Tallaabooyinka','Activate'=>'Hawl geli','Activate Free Version'=>'Aawinta Nooc Bilaash Ah','Activate License'=>'Firida Shatiga','activate a license here'=>'hawlgeli ruqsad halkan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Fadlan geli furaha shatiga ee aad ku heshay iimaylka isla markiiba ka dib iibsashada:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Shati ka yeeli dhammaan goobaha shabakadda ku jira.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Dhaqaaji shatiga dhammaan mareegaha sugaya.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Nooca lacagta ah ee %1$s waa horay loo rakibay. Fadlan hawlgeli si aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga astaamaha %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'Nooca lacagta ah ee %1$s waa horay loo rakibay. Fadlan u gudub %2$s si aad u bilowdo oo aad uga faa\'iidaysato sifooyinka %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Fududee ku-lammaanahan','Activate %s'=>'Kici %s','Activate %s features'=>'Hawlgalinta sifooyinka %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Hadda Dhammaystir Hawlgelinta "%s"','Activate %s Plan'=>'Dhaqaaji Qorshaha %s','Activated'=>'La hawl-galiyey','Activating'=>'Firigaya','Activating license'=>'Shatiyada waa la hawlgelinayaa','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Koontadaada waxaa lagu guuleystay in lagu hawlgeliyo qorshaha %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Shaqaynaya','Add another domain'=>'Ku dar domain kale','Add-Ons'=>'Ku-dar-yaalka','Add Ons for %s'=>'Tilmaamaha %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Waan awoodi weynnay inaan soo rarno liiska agabka dheeraadka ah. Waxaa laga yaabaa inay arrintu ka timid dhinaceenna, fadlan isku day inaad soo noqoto daqiiqado gudahood.','Add-On'=>'Ku dar','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s waa wax-ku-kordhin lacag ah oo keliya. Waa inaad marka hore iibsataa shati ka hor inta aanad hawlgelinin furaha barnaamijka.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'%s Ku-darkinta waxaa si guul leh loo iibsaday.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Qorshahaaga %s Add-on si guul leh ayaa loo casriyeeyay.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'%s ee tijaabada bilaashka ah waa la joojiyay. Maadaama ku-darista ay tahay mid qiimo leh oo kaliya, si toos ah ayaa loo demiyay. Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad isticmaasho mustaqbalka, waa inaad iibsataa ruqsad.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ma shaqeyn karo plug-in-ka la\'aanteed.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ma shaqeyn karo la\'aanteed %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kaliya waxaan ku ogeysiinayaa in xogta dheeriga ah ee %s laga soo jiidayo server dibadeed.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Ku-darista module %s','Address Line %d'=>'Cinwaanka %d','Affiliate'=>'Wakiilka','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sababtoo ah xadgudubka shuruudaha xiriirinta, waxaan go\'aansanay inaan si ku-meel-gaar ah u xirno akoonkaaga xiriirinta. Haddii aad qabtid wax su\'aalo ah, fadlan la xiriir taageerada.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Koontadaada xiriirka waxaa la joojiyay si KMG ah.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Codsigaaga wada-shaqeynta ee %1$s waa la aqbalay! Soo gal aaggaaga wada-shaqeynta adoo isticmaalaya: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Waan ku mahadcelineynaa codsigaaga ku aaddan barnaamijka shuraakada, nasiib darro, waxaan go\'aansannnay inaan diidno codsigaaga wakhtigan. Fadlan isku day mar labaad 30 maalmood ka dib.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad soo codsatay barnaamijkayaga xiriirinta, waxaan haysan doonaa xogtaada 14-ka maalmood ee soo socota waxaanana kuugu soo jawaabi doonaa macluumaad dheeraad ah.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s raadraaca buskutiyada ka dib booqashada ugu horreysa si loo kordhiyo dakhliga suurtagalka ah.','Affiliation'=>'Xubinimada','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Markabkagu dhaco, wali waad isticmaali kartaa nooca Bilaashka ah laakiin MA heli doontid sifooyinka %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Marka ay shatigaagu dhacdo, ma awoodi doontid inaad sii isticmaashid %s, illaa aad dib uga hawlgeliso shati lacag-bixin ah oo sax ah.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Weli waad ku raaxaysan kartaa dhammaan sifooyinka %1$s laakiin ma heli doontid amniga iyo cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka ee %2$s, mana heli doontid taageero.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay kor u qaadista.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Ka dib %1$s-kaaga bilaashka ah, bixi wax aan badnayn %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Oggolow & Fududee Shatiga','I Agree - Change User'=>'Waan Ku Heshiiyay - Beddel Isticmaalaha','All Requests'=>'Dhammaan Codsiyada','All Types'=>'Noocyada oo dhan','allow'=>'ogolow','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Horay baad ugu biirtay raadraaca isticmaalkayaga, taasoo naga caawisa inaan sii wadano horumarinta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Waxaad horay uga qayb qaadatay la socodka isticmaalkayaga, taas oo naga caawisa inaan sii wadano horumarintooda.','Amount'=>'Cadadka','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Sanadkii','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Sanad kasta','Anonymous feedback'=>'Jawaab-celinta qarsoodiga ah','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Ku dabool dhammaan mareegaha shabakadda.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Ku dabool dhammaan mareegaha sugaya.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Codsos si aad u noqotid xubin ku-xigeen','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Anqari & Bilow Tijaabada','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Fadlan noogu sheeg sababta si aan u horumarino.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli ciwaanka iimaylka ee aad u isticmaashay casriyeynta hoos waxaanuna dib kuu soo diri doonaa furaha shatiga.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli cinwaanka iimeylka ee aad isticmaashay intii lagu guda jiray iibsashada waxaanuna dib kuu soo diri doonaa furaha shatiga.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'La xiriir koontada mulkiilaha liisanka.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Qoraa','Invalid module ID.'=>'Aqoonsiga qaybtu waa mid aan ⁠sax ahayn.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ma haytid shati sax ah oo aad ku gasho nooca qaaliga ah.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Ku-rakibidda otomaatiga ah waxay u shaqeysaa oo keliya isticmaaleyaasha is-diiwaangeliyey.','Premium version already active.'=>'Nooca qaaliga ah ayaa mar hore hawlgelin ah.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Nooca lagu daray ee qaaliga ah ayaa horay loo rakibay.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin waa "Serviceware", taas oo la macno ah inuusan lahayn nooc code ah oo lacag ah.','Automatic Installation'=>'Ku-shubidda Tooska ah','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Demi si toban ah:','Average Rating'=>'Ugu Raytingka Dhexeysa','Awesome'=>'Cajiib','based on %s'=>'ku saleys verbunden %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Noqo xubin xiriir ah','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Ma jeceshahay %s? Noqo danjirahayaga oo lacag kasbo ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Haye, ma ogtahay in %1$s uu leeyahay barnaamij la-tashi ah? Haddii aad jeceshahay %2$s waxaad noqon kartaa safiirkeenna oo aad kasban kartaa xoogaa lacag ah!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Ugu Fiican','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Cusboonaysiiyaha nooca Beta wuxuu bedeli doonaa nuqulkaaga %s ee la rakibay oo wuxuu ku rakibi doonaa nooca Beta ee ugu dambeeyay - isticmaal adigoo taxaddar leh, hana ku isticmaalin mareegaha wax-soo-saarka. Waa laguu digay.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'La billay %s','Billing'=>'Biilasha','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biilasha & Rasiidka','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Xiray','Blocking'=>'Xannibayaa','Blog ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Blog-ga','Body'=>'Qoraalka jidhka','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Haa - labada ciwaanba waa kuwayga','Bundle'=>'Xirmo','Bundle Plan'=>'Qorshaha Xirmada','Business name'=>'Magaca ganacsiga','Buy license'=>'Iibsow ruqxsadda','Buy a license now'=>'Hadda iibso ruqsad','Cancel'=>'Jooji','Cancel Installation'=>'Jooji Rakibaadda','Cancel Subscription'=>'Jooji Is-diiwaangelinta','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Haddii aadan qorsheyneyn inaad isticmaasho %1$sogan boggogan (ama bog kale kasta) - ma jeceshahay inaad joojiso %2$soga sidoo kale?','Cancel Trial'=>'Jooji Imtixaanka','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Joojinta tijaabada waxay si degdeg ah u xireysaa helitaanka dhammaan sifooyinka qiimaha leh. Ma hubtaa?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Jooji %s & Sii wad','Cancelled'=>'La joojiyay','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Joojinaya rukumashada','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ma heli kartid furahaaga shatiga?','Change License'=>'Beddel Shatiga','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Email xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Waa inaad xaqiijisaa cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota. Haddii aadan heli karin email-ka, fadlan hubi galkaaga spam-ka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Farriin xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Mulkiilaha iimaylku waa inuu xaqiijiyo cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota gudahooda.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s waa milkiilaha cusub ee koontada.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Mahadsan sanad in aad xaqiijisay beddelka lahaanshaha. Iimayl ayaa hadda loo diray %s si loo ansixiyo ugu dambeeya.','Change Ownership'=>'Beddel Mulkiilaha','Change Plan'=>'Beddel Qorshaha','Change User'=>'Beddel Isticmaalaha','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Adigoo bedelaya isticmaalaha, waxaad ogolaanaysaa inaad u wareejiso la-wareegidda koontada:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Taariikhda wax-ka-beddelka','Changing user, please wait'=>'Isticmaalaha waa la beddelayaa, fadlan sug','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Haddii aadan helin iimaylka, isku day inaad hubiso galkaaga spam-ka ama ka raadi iimaylleyda ka yimid %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Lacag bixinta','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Dooro ilaa %s goob(bo) si aad shatiga ugu shaqeyso.','City'=>'Magaalo','Clear API Cache'=>'Nadiifi Kaydka API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Nadiifi Cusboonaysiisyada Ku-meel-gaarka ah','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Halkan guji si aad plugin-ka u isticmaasho adigoo anaan looga aqoon','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Guji si aad u aragto faallooyinka bixiyay qiimeynta %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s waa cinwaanka iimaylka ee macmiilkayga','Code'=>'Koodh','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'%s oo ah guddiyo marka macmiilku iibsado ruqsad cusub.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Maaddaama aanu 30 maalmood u kaydinayno suurtagalnimada dib-u-bixinta, waxaan bixin karnaa oo keliya komishannada ka weyn 30 maalmood.','Communication'=>'Isgaarsiinta','Compatible up to'=>'La jaanqaadi kara ilaa','complete the opt-in'=>'dhameystir isdiiwaangelinta','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hambalyo','Never miss an important update'=>'Weligi ha seegin wararka cusub ee muhiimka ah','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Mahadsan sanid in aad u cusbooneysiisay %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Iska diwaangeli si aad u hesho ogeysiisyada iimeelka ee ku saabsan amniga & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarkood, iyo inaad la wadaagto xoogaa xog ah oo aasaasi ah oo ku saabsan jawiga WordPress. Tani waxay naga caawin doontaa inaan %s ka dhigno mid ku habboon boggaaga oo ka sii wanaagsan qabashada waxa aad uga baahan tahay.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Ku biir si aad u hesho ogeysiisyo iimayl oo ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, waxyaabo waxbarasho, iyo dalabyo mararka qaar, oo aad la wadaagto macluumaad guud oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Haddii aad ka gudubto arrintan, waa caadi! %1$s weli si fiican ayuu u shaqayn doonaa.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Waxaan soo bandhignay ikhtiyaarkan si aadan weligaba u seegin cusboonaysiin muhiim ah oo naga caawiso inaan ka dhigno %s mid si fiican ula jaanqaadaysa boggaaga isla markaana si wanaagsan u qabata waxa aad uga baahan tahay.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Waan ku faraxsanahay inaan soo bandhigno is-dhexgalka heerka shabakadda ee Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Intii lagu guda jiray habka cusboonaysiinta waxaan ka helnay shabakadaha %s ee ku jira shabakada kuwaas oo weli u baahan dareenkaaga.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Inta lagu jiro habka cusboonaysiinta, waxaanu ogaanay %d goob(bo) oo weli sugaysa in shatiga la hawlgeliyo.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad isticmaasho %s ee ku yaal bogaggaas, fadlan gelifurahaaga sharciga hoos oo guji badhanka hawlgelinta.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Haddii kale, waad ka boodi kartaa hadda oo aad shatiga hawlgelin kartaa dib, bogga Akoonka heerka shabakadda ee %sda.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Xiran','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Markaad dhamaysato, dami %s oo dib u daari.','Contact'=>'La xiriir','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Fadlan nagu soo wargeli haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaynu kula soo xiriirno wixii ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga & sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarkood:','Contact Support'=>'La xiriir Taageerada','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Waan ka xumahay dhibaatada soo gaartay, waana joognaa si aan ku caawino haddii aad na siiso fursad.','Contact Us'=>'Nala Xiriir','Please contact us here'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir halkan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir fariintan soo socota:','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Contributors'=>'Ka qaybqaatayaasha','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Lama hawlgelin karo %s.','Country'=>'Waddanka','Cron Type'=>'Nooca Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Waxaan u adeegs