iga:','Thanks, please wait'=>'Mahadsanid, fadlan sug','Thanks %s!'=>'Mahadsanid %s!','The following products\''=>'Alaabooyinka soo socda','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.the installation instructions'=>'tilmaamaha rakibaadda','"The <product_label>", e.g.: "The plugin"The %s\'s'=>'%s ka','Theme'=>'Mawduuc','Theme Switch'=>'Beddelka Mawduuca','Themes'=>'Mawduucyada','Themes page'=>'Bogga mawduucyada','This will allow %s to'=>'Tani waxay oggolaan doontaa %s inuu','Timestamp'=>'Waqtiga la duubay','Terms of Service'=>'Shuruudaha Adeegga','Total'=>'Wadarta','Town'=>'Magaalo madaxda','Seems like we are having some temporary issue with your trial cancellation. Please try again in few minutes.'=>'Waxaa u muuqata inay jirto dhibaato ku-meel-gaar ah oo ka haysata joojinta tijaabadaada. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado kadib.','Your %s free trial was successfully cancelled.'=>'Tijaabadaada bilaashka ah ee %s si guul leh ayaa loo joojiyay.','It looks like you are not in trial mode anymore so there\'s nothing to cancel :)'=>'Waxaa u muuqata inaadan ku jirin habka tijaabada hadda markaas ma jirto wax la joojiyo :)','Your free trial has expired. You can still continue using all our free features.'=>'Tijaabadaadii bilaashka ahayd waa dhacday. Weli waad sii wadan kartaa isticmaalka dhammaan sifooyinkayaga bilaashka ah.','Your free trial has expired. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s to continue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Mudadaagii tijaabada ahayd ee bilaashka ahayd way dhacday. %1$sHadda cusboonaysii%2$s si aad si aan kala go\' lahayn ugu sii isticmaasho %3$s.','Plan %s do not exist, therefore, can\'t start a trial.'=>'Qorshaha %s ma jiro, sida awgeed, lama bilaabi karo tijaabo.','Your trial has been successfully started.'=>'Imtixaankaaga waa la bilaabay si guul leh.','You already utilized a trial before.'=>'Waxaad horay u isticmaashay tijaabo.','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'Sidee baad u jeceshahay %1$s ilaa iyo hadda? Tijaabi dhammaan sifooyinkaaga %2$s ee qaaliga ah adoo isticmaalaya %3$d maalmood oo tijaabo ah oo bilaash ah.','Type'=>'Nooc','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'Lama xiriiri karo nidaamka faylalka. Fadlan xaqiiji aqoonsigaaga.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'Waxaa jiray qalad API ah oo aan la fileynin inta lagu guda jiray ka shaqaynta codsigaaga. Fadlan isku day mar labaad daqiiqado gudahood oo haddii aysan weli shaqaynyn, la xiriir qoraaga %s adiga oo wata kan soo socda:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Khalad aan la filayn, fadlan isku day mar kale 5 daqiiqo gudahood. Haddii khaladku sii jiro, fadlan la xiriir taageerada.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Meel-ka-saarida %s waxay si toos ah u joojin doontaa shatiga, kaas oo aad awoodi doontid inaad ku isticmaasho degel kale.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Waxaa dhacay qalad aan la aqoon.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Guddiyo aan xad lahayn.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Cusboonaysiin aan xadidnayn','verbUpdate'=>'Cusbooneysii','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad ku sii waddo cusboonaysiinta?','Update'=>'Cusbooneysii','Update License'=>'Cusboonaysii Shatiga','Upgrade'=>'Codsii Kor U Qaadis','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Ogeysiiska Cusboonaysiinta Muhiimka ah:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'So degso oo hawlgeli nooca la soo dejiyey','User Dashboard'=>'Guddiga Isticmaalaha','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, ma aan badbaadin karnaa cusboonaysiinta iimeylka. Isticmaale kale oo wata iimeylkan ayaa horay u diiwaangashan.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad u wareejiso lahaanshaha akoonka %1$s qofka ah %2$s, riix badhanka Beddel Lahaanshaha.','User ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Isticmaalaha','User key'=>'Fureheeda Isticmaalaha','Users'=>'Isticmaalayaasha','Value'=>'Qiimaha','Verification mail was just sent to %s. If you can\'t find it after 5 min, please check your spam box.'=>'Xaqiijinta iเมล ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Haddii aadan heli karin 5 daqiiqadood ka dib, fadlan hubi sanduuqaaga spam-ka.','Verified'=>'La xaqiijiyay','Verify Email'=>'Xaqiiji Iimaylka','product versionVersion'=>'Nuqul','Version %s was released.'=>'Nooca %s waa la soo saaray.','View details'=>'Eeg macluumaadka','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'Guji si aad u aragto shaashadda oo buuxda %d','View paid features'=>'Eeg sifooyinka la bixiyo','Warning'=>'Digniin','What is your %s?'=>'Waa maxay %s-kaagu?','Used to express elation, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'W00t','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'Bogga Bulsada ee WordPress.org','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'Waxay u muuqataa in mid ka mid ah xuduudaha xaqiijinta uu khaldan yahay. Cusboonaysii Furahaaga Dadweynaha, Furaha Sirta ah & Aqoonsiga Isticmaalaha, oo dib u day.','%s ago'=>'%s ka hor','as 5 licenses left%s left'=>'%s ayaa ka haray','%s or higher'=>'%s ama ka sarreeya','%s\'s paid features'=>'Tilmaamaha lacagta ah ee %s','e.g. Professional Plan%s Plan'=>'%s Qorshaha','%s rating'=>'qiimaynta %s','%s ratings'=>'%s qiimaynaha','%s sec'=>'%s ilb','%s star'=>'%s xiddig','%s stars'=>'%s xiddigood','%s time'=>'%s wakhti','%s times'=>'%s jeerood','You have successfully updated your %s.'=>'Waxaad si guul leh u cusboonaysiisay %s.','as annual periodyear'=>'sanad','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'Yee-haw','Yes'=>'Haa','You are all good!'=>'Wax walba waa hagaag!','You are just one step away - %s'=>'Waxaad jirtaa hal tallaabo oo keliya - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'Waxaa u muuqata inaad heshay nooca ugu dambeeyay.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Waxaad heli doontaa %3$s ee %1$s sanduuqaaga boostada ee %2$s 5ta daqiiqo ee soo socota.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Lambarka Boostada / Koodka Boosaska',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s si aad u hesho nooca %2$s ee amniga & cusboonaysiinta astaamaha, iyo taageerada.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'Cusboonaysiinta amniga & sifooyinka tooska ah ee %1$s iyo shaqada lacagta ah waxay sii shaqayn doonaan iyada oo aan la helin wax kala go\'a ilaa %2$s (ama marka uu ruqsaddaadu dhaco, doorkii horreeya).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s si aad u hesho nooca %2$s ee amniga & casriyeynta muuqaalada, iyo taageerada.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon ayaa dhacay intii lagu jiray isku dayga lagu dejinayay habka beta ee isticmaalaha.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon ayaa dhacay intii lagu jiray isku dayga lagu beddelayo qaabka calaamadda cad ee shatiga.','Annual'=>'Sanadle','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Markii aad gujiso "Opt Out", %s mar dambe ma awoodi doonto inay aragto magacaaga iyo iimaylkaaga.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Ka bax", xogta ogaanshaha cilladaha mar dambe looma diri doono %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Marka website-ka la gooyo, xogta ogaanshaha cilladaha ee hore loo wadaagay ee ku saabsan %1$s waa la tirtiri doonaa mana sii muuqan doonto %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Adigoo ka baxaya in aad macluumaadkan la wadaagto server-ka cusboonaysiinta, waa inaad ka eegtaa si aad u ogaato %1$s cusub oo la soo saaray aadna gacanta ugu soo dejisato oo aad u rakibto. Ma aha oo kaliya dhibaato, laakiin seegista cusboonaysiinta waxay gelin kartaa mareegahaaga halis waxayna keeni kartaa dhibaatooyin waafaqsan oo aan loo baahnayn, markaa waxaan si weyn ugu talineynaa in aad haysato ogolaanshaha lagama maarmaanka ah.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Jooji %1$s - Uma baahni mar dambe wax cusboonaysiin ah oo ku saabsan amniga & astaamaha, mana u baahni taageero ku aaddan %2$s sababta oo ah ma qorshaynayo inaan isticmaalo %3$s kan, ama degel kale oo kasta.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ma joojisaa %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Joojinaya %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'La joojinayaa %s...','Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Deactivating'=>'Deminaya','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Joojinta xiriirka shabakadda waxay si joogto ah uga saari doontaa %s koontadaada Dashboardka Isticmaalaha.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Si loo helo dhalinta tooska ah ee amniga & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, iyo maamulka & ilaalinta shatiga, %s waxay u baahan tahay in la:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Si loo gaarsiiyo amniga & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, iyo maaraynta shatiga, %s waxay u baahan tahay inaanay','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius waa shatigayaga iyo matoorayada cusboonaysiinta barnaamijka','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Haddii tani ay tahay nuqul muddo dheer ah, si aad u ilaaliso cusboonaysiinta tooska ah iyo shaqaynta lacagta lagu bixiyo %1$s ka dib, fadlan %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Ma %2$s ma waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Ku biir Barnaamijka Beta-ha','Join the Beta program'=>'Ku biir barnaamijka Beta','License'=>'Sugoomi','License Key'=>'Furaha Shatiga','License key'=>'Furaha ruqhadda','Monthly'=>'Bishiiba','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Magacyada, gaaban (slugs), noocyada, iyo haddii ay shaqeynayaan iyo inkale','New Version Available'=>'Nooca Cusub Waa La Heli Karaa','Optional'=>'Ikhtiyaari','Plan'=>'Qorshe','Products'=>'Alaabaha','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Xogta baaritaanka oo la wadaago waxay gacan ka geysataa bixinta shaqooyin dheeraad ah oo khuseeya mareegahaaga, ka fogaanshaha WordPress ama noocyada PHP ee aan is-waafaqeyn ee jabin kara mareegaha, iyo aqoonsashada luqadaha & gobollada ay tahay in %s loo turjumo laguna habeeyo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Markaas waxaad dib u isticmaali kartaa shatiga marka uusan %s mar dambe shaqaynayn.','Subscription'=>'Rukun-dhaqmeed','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s waxay si joogto ah ugu diri doontaa xogta ruqsadaha ee muhiimka ah %2$s si ay u hubiso amniga iyo cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, isla markaana ay u xaqiijiso ansaxnimada ruqsadadaada.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Waxaa jira %1$s oo ah %2$s la heli karo.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Si loo hubiyo waafaqidda loogana fogaado is-khilaafka plugins-ka iyo mawduucyada aad rakibtay.','Trial'=>'Tijaabo','View %s State'=>'Fiiri Xaaladda %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Arag macluumaadka guud ee %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Haa, %2$s waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s ujeedada tijaabada, diyaarinta, ama horumarinta.','You have a %s license.'=>'Waxaad haysataa shati %s ah.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Waxaad iibsatay shati ah %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Waxaad tahay in aad ka hesho iimayl xaqiijin ah %1$s sanduuqaaga iimaylka ee ku yaal %2$s. Fadlan hubi inaad gujiso badhanka ku jira iimaylkaas si aad %3$s.','days'=>'maalmaha','deactivating'=>'gabayaa','hour'=>'saacad','hours'=>'saacadood','license'=>'shati','optional'=>'ikhtiyaari ah','products'=>'Alaabooyinka','skip'=>'ka bood','subscription'=>'ruun-gelinta','trial'=>'tijaabo','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Alaabooyinka','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Waa la hawlgelinayaa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Sugoomi','close a windowDismiss'=>'Iska kaydso','close windowDismiss'=>'Ka tago','like websitesSites'=>'Goobaha','nounPricing'=>'Qiimaha','trial periodTrial'=>'Imtixaan','verbOpt In'=>'Ogolaado','verbOpt Out'=>'Ka bax','verbSkip'=>'Ka bood','verbUpgrade'=>'Cusbooneysii','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s ka hor','Blocks with repeated items, and synced patterns'=>'Xannibaadyada leh walxaha soo noqnoqda, iyo qaababka la waafajiyay','WooCommerce products'=>'Alaabooyinka WooCommerce','Comments and reviews'=>'Faallooyinka iyo dib u eegisyada','Translated automatically from %s.'=>'Waxaa si otomaatig ah looga turjumay %s.','WooCommerce currencies'=>'Lacagaha WooCommerce','Currency'=>'Lacagta','The rate source does not quote %s, the shop\'s currency.'=>'Ilaha qiimuhu ma soo xigashaynayso %s, lacagta dukaanka.','"%s" is not a currency WooCommerce knows, or it is the shop\'s own currency.'=>'"%s" ma aha lacag ay ogtahay WooCommerce, ama waa lacagta dukaanka laftiisa.','Enter a rate above zero for %s, like 0.92.'=>'Geli qiime ka sarreeya eber oo ah %s, sida 0.92.','Rounding steps and price endings are amounts, like 0.05 or 0.99.'=>'Tallaabooyinka wareejinta iyo dhammaadka qiimuhu waa lacag, sida 0.05 ama 0.99.','Custom fields (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)'=>'Goobaha caadiga ah (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)','Choose translate, copy or leave empty for each field.'=>'Beegso turjun, koobiyee ama uga tag faaruq goob kasta.','Forms (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)'=>'Foomamka (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)','I enter the rates myself'=>'Qiimaha anna iskaya qora','European Central Bank, updated daily (free, no account needed)'=>'Bankiga Dhexe ee Yurub, oo la cusboonaysiiyo maalin kasta (bilaash, akoon looma baahna)','The European Central Bank answered %d. The last rates are kept.'=>'Bankiga Dhexe ee Yurub wuxuu jawaabay %d. Sicirada ugu dambeeya waa la hayaa.','The European Central Bank\'s feed held no rates. The last rates are kept.'=>'Bangiga Dhexe ee Yurub feed-kiisu ma hayo wax dulsaar ah. Dulsaarkii ugu dambeeyay waa la hayaa.','That exchange-rate source is not available.'=>'Ilaha sarrifka lacagtaas lama heli karo.','SEO plugins (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)'=>'Qalabka SEO (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)','Theme and plugin text'=>'Mawduuca iyo qoraalka qalabka dheeraadka ah','That theme or plugin is not active on this site.'=>'Noocyadaas ama furahaas kuma shaqeeyaan boggan.','Language suggestion'=>'Tusaalaha luqadda','This page is also available in %s.'=>'Boggan sido kale waxaa lagu heli karaa %s.','Read it in %s'=>'Ku aqri %s','No thanks'=>'Maya mahad sanid','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'Dooro sida luuqaduhu uga muuqdaan cinwaanadaada: galka, subdomain-ka, domain gooni ah ama query parameter.','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Subdomains iyo domains gooni ah luqad kasta waa qayb ka mid ah Tranzly Pro.','The language folders must be a list.'=>'Grovaha luqaddu waa inay noqdaan liis.','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'"%s" ma noqon karo galka luqadda. Isticmaal 2 ilaa 12 xaraf oo yar, nambaro ama xariijimo, mid kasta oo luqad ahna waa inuu ka duwanaado, mana aha erey uu WordPress hore u isticmaalay.','The domains must be a list.'=>'Waxa uu domain-ku noqon doonaa liis.','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'"%s" ma aha magac domain ah, sida example.de.','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'Luqad kastaa waxay u baahan tahay domainkeeda gaarka ah.','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'Ciwaanka la turjumay waa inay noqdaan liis.','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'Erayada ciwaanka la turjumay waa in lagu qoraa luqad kasta.','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s" lama isticmaali karo ciwaanka. Isticmaal xarfaha yar yar, nambarada iyo xariiqda hoose.','This setting is on or off.'=>'Dejintaan waa mid shaqaynaysa ama dansan.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Bogagga aan la turjumin ee laga qariyo mashiinnada raadinta waa qayb ka mid ah Tranzly Pro.','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'Luqadaha','Languages (side by side)'=>'Luqadaha (isku dhinac yaalla)','Add to Menu'=>'Ku dar Liiska','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'Goobtaada, shaygan wuxuu muujinayaa luqadaha goobta, mid walba oo ka mid ah wuxuu ku xirayaa bogga hadda ku jira luqaddaas.','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'Xiriiriyeyaasha boggan ee luqad kasta oo ka mid ah luqadahaaga.','Language name'=>'Magaca luqadda','Language code'=>'Aamadda luqadda','Name and code'=>'Magaca iyo koodka','Design'=>'Naqshadeyn','Show each language as'=>'Mid kasta oo ka mid ah luqadaha u muuji sida','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'Muuji calammada (calanku waa waddan, ee ma aha luqad)','List'=>'Liiska','Pills'=>'Kiniiniyada','Buttons'=>'Badhamada','Dropdown'=>'Liiska hoos-u-dhaca','Language codes'=>'Codes of the language','Flags'=>'Calanmadaha','Include the current language'=>'Ku dar luuqadda hadda jirta','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Qari luuqadaha aan boggan lagu tarjumin','Stack vertically'=>'Ku dheji taagan','Accessible label'=>'Calaamadda la heli karo','Text'=>'Qoraal','Background'=>'Asalka','Current language text'=>'Luqadda hadda taagan','Current language background'=>'Asalka luqadda ee hadda jira','Border'=>'Xudduud','Corner radius'=>'Geeska wareegga','Space between languages'=>'Isku xirka luqadaha','Text size'=>'Cabirka qoraalka','Switcher'=>'Beddelaha','(no title)'=>'(cinwaan ma jiro)','There is nothing to fix here.'=>'Halkan wax lagu hagaajiyo ma jiraan.','No content type is translated on this site.'=>'Ma jiro nooc ka mid ah nuxurka oo laga turjumay boggan.','That content type is not translated on this site.'=>'Nooca waxa ku jira lama turjumin boggan.','There is nothing to translate in that selection.'=>'Doorashadaas wax tarjumaad ah ma leh.','Choose at least one language to translate into.'=>'Dooro ugu yaraan hal luqad oo lagu turjumo.','You are not allowed to export translations.'=>'Laguma oggola inaad dhoofiso turjumaadaha.','Choose an XLIFF or CSV file to import.'=>'Dooro xayaysiiska XLIFF ama CSV si aad u soo dejiso.','That is not a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file. Export one first, translate it, and import it here.'=>'Kaasi ma aha fayl Tranzly XLIFF ama CSV ah. Mid dhoofi marka hore, turjun, kadibna halkan ku soo rarrab.','The file could not be stored for importing. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faylka lama keydin karin si loo soo dejiyo. Hubi in galka soo-gelinta la qori karo.','That import is not there any more. Upload the file again.'=>'So dejintaas mar dambe ma jirto. Fadlan faylka soo geli mar kale.','That page is not on this site any more.'=>'Boggaas hadda kuma jiro boggan.','The file is for a language this site does not have.'=>'Faylku waa luqad uusan boggani lahayn.','Could not link %1$s %2$d: %3$s'=>'Lama xiriirin karo %1$s %2$d: %3$s','Post #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Qoraalka #%1$d: %2$s','No data from that plugin was found on this site.'=>'Lama helin wax xog ah oo ka yimid barnaamijkan dheeraadka ah (plugin-ka) boggan.','This is not a translation of anything on this site.'=>'Kani ma aha turjumaadda wax kasta oo ku yaalkan boggan.','There is no text to check.'=>'Ma jiro qoraal la hubiyo.','The AI settings are not part of this build.'=>'Dejinta AI ma qayb ka aha dhismahan.','The AI provider did not answer.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-ga wax jawaab ah ma bixin.','The AI model did not score every part of this page. Try again, or choose another model.'=>'Model-ka AI-ga ma uusan qiimayn qayb kasta oo ka mid ah boggan. Mar kale isku day, ama dooro model kale.','Translator'=>'Turjumaan','Translation reviewer'=>'Turjumidda dib-u-eegaha','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation.'=>'Falanqeeye ayaa codsaday in wax ka beddel lagu sameeyo turjumaaddan.','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation: %s'=>'Dib-u-eegene waxay codsaday in wax ka beddel lagu sameeyo turjumaaddan: %s','This translation is waiting for a reviewer. Publishing it (as a reviewer) approves it.'=>'Tarjaddan waxay sugeysaa dib-u-eegis. Daabacaaddeeda (sida dib-u-eegis) waxay ansixinaysaa.','Only a translation can be reviewed.'=>'Kaliya turjumaad ayaa dib-u-eegis lagu sameyn karaa.','Choose what happens when an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Dooro waxa dhacaya marka asalka la beddelo: waxba, calaamadee turjumaadaheeda inay dhaceen, ama turjun mar kale.','The quality threshold is a score from 0 to 100.'=>'Iridka tayadu waa dhibco ka bilaabma 0 ilaa 100.','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Mar kale tus talooyinka la qariyay ee ku jira Guudmarka','All'=>'Dhammaan','%d selected'=>'%d la doortay' . "\0" . '%d la doortay','Nothing matches.'=>'Waxba ma waafaqsana.','Select all on this page'=>'Dooro dhammaan boggan','Select'=>'Dooro','Pages'=>'Bogagga','Previous'=>'Kan hore','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Bogga %1$d ee %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'%s ku deji daqiiqado kooban gudahood','Start setup'=>'Bilow habaynta','This site'=>'Goobtan','Edition'=>'Daabacad','Sites on this licence'=>'Goobaha ku jira ruqsaddan','Version'=>'Nooc','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Tani waxay u egtahay nuqul tijaabo ah ama maxalli ah, markaa ma isticmaasho goob shatigaaga ku jirta.','See what Pro adds'=>'Arag waxa uu Pro ku daro','Go to'=>'Tagay','Personal'=>'Shakhsi','Business'=>'Ganacsi','Agency'=>'Wakiilnimo','Any number of sites'=>'Shabakado kasta oo tiro leh','Unlimited sites'=>'Bogos aan xadidnayn','%d site'=>'%d goob' . "\0" . '%d goobood','Pro'=>'Xirfad leh','%s trial'=>'%s tijaabo','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Tijaabadaadu waa bilaabatay. Dib u rár bogga si aad u aragto astaamo kasta oo Pro ah.','The trial could not be started.'=>'Tijaabada lama bilaabi karin.','Feature'=>'Muuqaal','Included'=>'Ku jira','Not included'=>'Lama dariin','Your licence'=>'Shatiinkaada','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d ka mid ah %2$d oo isticmaal ah','Renews'=>'Cusboonaysaa','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Nuqullada tijaabada ah, kuwa tijaabada iyo kuwa localhost ee barta waa kuwo bilaash ah oo aan weligood lagu darin xadkaaga goobta.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Qorshahaagu wuxuu ka mid yahay taageerada mudnaanta leh.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Maaree ruqxsaddaada iyo biilashaada','Get more with Pro'=>'Ka hel wax badan Pro-ga','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Bilow tijaabo lacag la\'aan ah oo ah %d maalmood, kaarka looma baahna' . "\0" . 'Bilow tijaabo lacag la\'aan ah oo ah %d maalmood, kaarka looma baahna','See plans and prices'=>'Eeg qorshayaasha iyo qiimaha','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad si wadajir ah u isticmaasho Tranzly iyo Page Builder Sandwich? Xirmada waxaa ku jira labada qalab ee Pro qiimo dhimis ah.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Lesensigaagu wuu dhacay. Dib u cusbooneysii si aad u sii wadato helista wixii ku soo kordha iyo sifooyinka Pro.','Renew now'=>'Hadda cusbooneysii','Compare the plans'=>'Isbarbar dhig qorshayaasha','Search features'=>'Raadi astaamaha','Area'=>'Goob','Included in'=>'Ku jira','No feature matches.'=>'Ma jiro wax sifo ah oo waafaqsan.','Features by plan'=>'Astaamaha qorshaha kasta','Hide'=>'Qari','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Ka howlgeli shaashadda Plugins-ka','Install it'=>'Ku rakib','Overview'=>'Guud mar','Setup'=>'Dejinta','Plans and licence'=>'Qorshayaasha iyo Shatiga','Add-ons'=>'Ku-dar-sooyada','Get help'=>'Hel hel','Feedback'=>'Jawaab-celin','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Doorashadaada lama keydin karo.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Xaaladda dejinta lama kaydin karin.','Match my computer'=>'Isku ekaysii kombuyuutarkayga','Light'=>'Iftiin','Dark'=>'Madow','Colour scheme'=>'Qaabka midabka','Help'=>'Caawinaad','Guide to this screen'=>'Hageynta shaashaddan','Take the tour'=>'Soo qaado dalxiiska','Get help or report a bug'=>'Helbi caawimaad ama sheeg cillad','Plugin screens'=>'Shaashadaha plugin-ka','That could not be saved.'=>'Taasi lama kaydin karo.','Before you contact support'=>'Int IndexPath xiriirinta taageerada','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Codsigaaga waxaa laga soo diray boggan ku socda %s, oo sameeya plugin-kan. Waxaan dirnaa:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'cinwaankaaga iimeylka iyo magacaaga, si aan ugu jawaabi karno;','the subject and message you write;'=>'maadooyinka iyo fariimaha aad qorto;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'aqoonsigaaga shатsida, si macaamiisha wax bixisa ay mudnaan u helaan;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kaliya haddii aad calaamadiso: tafaasiisha bogga (noocyada WordPress iyo PHP, dulucda, qalabka dheeraadka ah, qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka iyadoo ereyada sirta ah iyo ciwaannada iimaylka la saaray), oo aad akhrisan kartid ka hor intaanad dirin;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'kaliya haddii aad ku dartid: xogta gelitaanka ee boggaaga, oo loo kaydiyay qaab lacagaysan lana tirtiray 30 maalmood gudahood marka codsigaaga la xiro.','Privacy policy'=>'Qaanuunka gaarka ah','I agree, continue'=>'Waan ku raacsanahay, sii wad','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Xiriirka lama hubin karo.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Taasi ma aysan shaqayn. Mar kale isku day.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® ayaa goysay balseetan.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® horey uma aqoonsaneyso boggan.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Waxaad ka jartay boggogan.','Connect this site to support'=>'Ku xir boggan taageero','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Ku xidhan. Jawaabuhu waxay aadayaan %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Lama xiriirin. Weli waxaad soo diri kartaa codsi adigoo isticmaalaya cinwaankaaga e-maylka ee hoose; xiriirintu waxay badbaadinaysaa inaad ku qorto mar kasta.','E-mail address'=>'Ciwaanka iimaylka','Your name (optional)'=>'Magacaaga (ikhtiyaari)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waxaan ogolahahay inaan ku xiro boggan taageerada Zinn Digital®. Waxay diraysaa ciwaanka boggan, noocyada WordPress iyo PHP iyo nooca plugin-ka, waana la gooyn karaa wakhti kasta halkaan ama Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Xiririyso','I need help'=>'Waxaan u baahanahay caawimaad','Report a bug'=>'Soo sheeg cillad','Send feedback'=>'So dir faallo','Request a feature'=>'Codso muuqaal cusub','The site details could not be read.'=>'Faahfaahinta goobta lama akhrin karo.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Codsigaaga lama diri karin. Iskey mar kale ugu day daqiiqado kadib.','WordPress admin'=>'Maamulka WordPress','File manager'=>'Maareeyaha faylasha','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Jawaab-celinta iyo codsiyada astaamaha','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Dirir. Tixraacaagu waa %s, jawaabteennuna waxay ku imaan doontaa iimayl ahaan.','What is it about?'=>'Maxaa lagu saabsan yahay?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Ku jawaab (email)','Subject'=>'Mowduuc','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Maxaad samaysay, maxaad filaysay, maxase halkii laga filayay dhacay?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Ku dar faahfaahinta goobta (noocyada, mawduuca, plugins-ka iyo qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Arag waxa la soo diray oo sax ah','Loading…'=>'Soo dejinaya…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Soogalalka taageerada (ikhtiyaari, waa la keydiyay iyagoo Sireysan)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Soo-gelitaanka waxaa la soo diraa oo kaliya oo ay la socoto eraygeeda sirta ah. Halkii aad kala bar buuxin lahayd saf, dhaaf oo ha buuxin gabi ahaanba.','Login address'=>'Ciwaanka gelitaanka','Username'=>'Magaca isticmaalaha','Password'=>'Furaha sirta ah','Add a login'=>'Ku dar galitaan','Create a temporary support login'=>'Abuur galitaanka taageero ee ku meelgaarka ah','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Isticmaale gooni ah oo loogu talagalay kooxdayada taageero, kaas oo aan helin ogolaansho isticmaalayaasha, rakibidda plugins-ka ama tafatirka koodka. Waxaa si toos ah loo tirtiraa marka uu dhaco, ama mar kasta oo aad kala noqoto hoos.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Haa, %d maalmood' . "\0" . 'Haa, %d maalmood','Send'=>'Dirir','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Liistada lama soo dejin karo.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Gelitaankaas waa la waayay in meesha laga saaro.','Temporary support logins'=>'Gawaarida taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Ma jiro. Taageeradu waxay oo keliya soo geli kartaa boggan haddii aad halkan ka abuurto akoon soo-galitaan.','expired, being removed'=>'muddo-dhaafay, la saarayaa','expires %s'=>'wuxuu dhacayaa %s','Revoke now'=>'Hadda tirtir','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Xir safarka','Back'=>'Dib u noqo','Everything in one place'=>'Wax kasta oo ku jira hal meel','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Tabahyadani waxay kuu hagaan shaashad kasta oo plugin-ka ah: dejinta, habaynta, liisankaaga, caawimada iyo wax ka badan.','Help on every screen'=>'Caawimaad shaashad kasta ah','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fur liiskan si aad u hesho hagaha shaashadda aad ku sugan tahay, dalxiiskan, ama aad noogu weydiiso caawimaad.','Light or dark'=>'Iftiin ama madow','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Dooro iftiin, madow, ama sida kombuyuutarkaaga oo kale. Doorashadaada adiga keligaa ayaa lagu xasuustaa.','Welcome'=>'Soo dhawoow','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Daladdan gaaban waxay tusinaysaa meelaha ay waxyaabaha yaalliin. Waad ka bixi kartaa wakhti kasta adigoo isticmaalaya Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Boggaaga hal eegmo','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Hormarka rakibidda iyo qorshahaaga waxaa lagu muujiyay halkan, iyadoo ay la socoto waxa xiga ee mudan in la qabto.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Qorshahaaga, inta ay le\'eg yihiin mareegaha uu daboolayo, iyo in nuqulkan mareegaha uu ka mid yahay xadkaas.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Isku day Pro ama kor u qaad','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Bilow tijaabo bilaash ah adigoo aan wadan kaar, kor u qaad, ama cusbooneysiin, dhammaantood halkaan ka samee.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Tilmaan kasta iyo qorshaha ay ku jirto. Ka raadi tilmaan ama soo bandhig hal aag markiiba.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Wax badan oo ka socda Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Furayaasha la shaqeeya kan, iyo adeegyada kooxdaas oo kale. Kaararka aad ku qarisay shaashadaha kale ayaa halkan mar kale lagu soo bandhigi karaa.','Connect for faster help'=>'Isku xidh si aad u hesho caawinaad degdeg ah','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Isku xirnaashuhu waa ikhtiyaari. Waxay kuu ogolaanaysaa inaad dirto codsiyo adigoon qorin iimaylkaaga mar kasta, waana aad ka gooyn kartaa mar kasta oo aad rabto.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Weydiiso caawimaad ama sheeg cilad','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Sharax waxa dhacay. Waxaad dooraneysaa in aad ku darto macluumaadka bogga, waxaadna arki kartaa waxa uu ku jiro kahor inta aadan soo dirin.','Temporary support access'=>'Helitaanka taageero ku-meel-gaar ah','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Haddii taageeradu u baahato inay eegto boggaaga gudihiisa, halkan ka abuur galitaan ku-meel-gaar ah. Wuu is-tirtiraa markuu dhaco, waadna ka saari kartaa wakhti kasta.','Tell us what to build'=>'Noo sheeg waxa aad rabto in la dhiso','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'So dir fikrad, codsi muuqaal ah ama wixii jawaab celin ah. Waxay si toos ah u aadaysaa kooxda.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Tani waxay qaadataa daqiiqado yar waxayna dejineysaa %s si uu si toos ah uga shaqeeyo bishan. Waxaad wax walba badali kartaa hadhow.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Waa aad diyaar tahay. Haddii waxa uu noqdo mid aan sidii loogu talagalay u shaqayn, hal guji oo kaliya ayaanu kuu jirnaa.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Dhammaad','Skip setup'=>'Ka bood habeynta','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Waxaa dhisay Neil Lock, oo ah madaxa fulinta ee Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Nooca %s','Tranzly website'=>'Websaydhka Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® website','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Fiiri qorshayaasha Pro iyo qiimaha','Languages'=>'Luqadaha','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Luqadda koowaad waa mida uu ku qoran yahay waxa ku jira. Booqdayaaluhu waxay ku beddelaan xannibaadda beddelaha luqadda.','(default)'=>'(caadi ah)','Find a language'=>'Raadi luuqad','Type its name in your language or in its own, then choose it. The code and name below fill in by themselves.'=>'Qor magaca luqadaada ama luqadeeda asalka ah, kadibna dooro. Koodhka iyo magaca hoose waxay ku buuxsamaan si toos ah.','Locale code'=>'Koodka deegaanka','For example fr_FR'=>'Tusaale ahaan fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Magaca (ikhtiyaari)','For example Français'=>'Tusaale ahaan Français','Add language'=>'Ku dar luuqad','Front-end output'=>'Soosaarka hore','Class name prefix'=>'Horgalaha magaca fasalka','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Magac kasta oo fasal ah oo uu plugin-ku ku daabaco baxyadaada wuxuu ka bilaabmayaa horgalahan, si aynaan baxyadu u muujin plugin-kii dhisay. 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yaryar ama nambaro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf.','Beta updates'=>'Cusbooneysiinaha Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Boggani waxay heshaa noocyada beta-da ah casriyeyn ahaan.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Boggan waxa uu helaa oo keliya noocyada xasilloon.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Ka beddel tan bogagga Akoonka','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Noocyada Beta waxaa la siiyaa rakibaadaha Pro ee shatiga leh ee ku xiran akoonkooda. Marka la xiro, waxaad kala soo biiri kartaa bogga Akoonka.','Save settings'=>'Keydso dejinta','First engine that is set up'=>'Mashiinka ugu horreeya ee la habeeyay','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'Furaha la keydiyay. Waxaa loo keydiyay si tas-hiilaad ah mana la soo bandhigi doono mar dambe.','Engine settings saved.'=>'Dejinta mashiinka waa la keydiyay.','Glossary saved.'=>'Glossary waa la keydiyay.','Your keys'=>'Furayaashaada','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly waxay wacdaa adeegyada tarjumaadda iyada oo adeegsanaysa akoonkaaga gaarka ah. Furayaasha waxaa lagu keydiyaa qaab siraysan xog-ururintaada waxaana loo diraa oo keliya adeegga ay ka tirsan yihiin. Furayaasha moodeelka AI waxaa lagu dejiyaa dejinta AI.','%s API key'=>'%s Furaha API','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'La kaydiyay: %s. Geli furaha cusub si aad u bedesho, ama kaydi meel bannaan si aad u tirtirto.','No key saved.'=>'Ma jiro fure la keydiyay.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Gobolka Azure (ka tag faaruq ilaa ilaha caalamiga ah)','Save key'=>'Key-ga kaydi','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Hubi isticmaalkayga DeepL','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'%1$s ka mid ah %2$s xarfaha la isticmaalay xilligan biilasha.','Which engine translates'=>'Muuqaalka turjumaya','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Weli mashiin lama hagaajin. Keydso furaha kor ku xusan (ama hagaaji moodeel AI ah) si aad u bilowdo turjumidda.','Default engine'=>'Mashiinka caadiga ah','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Mashiin kala duwan luuqad kasta, dib u noqoshada otomaatiga ah iyo xadka kharashka bisha waa astaamaha Tranzly Pro.','Engine for %s'=>'Mashiinka %s','The default engine'=>'Mashiinka caadiga ah','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Haddii mashiinku fashilmo ama uu gaaro xad, isku day kuwan xiga, nidaamkan','Monthly spending caps'=>'Xadka kharashka bisha','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Markuu matarku gaaro xadka ugu sarreeya, wax kale looma diro ilaa bisha xigta, warbixinta tarjumaadda guul-darreysayna waxay sheegaysaa sababta. U dhaaf madhan xad la\'aan.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (bishan la isticmaalay: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Kaydi xadka','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Eray-bixin iyo erayo aan waligood la turjumin','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Abid waligeed ha turjimin ereyadan (midkiiba hal saf)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Magacyada summadda iyo badeecadaha waxay ahaanayaan sidooda saxda ah, engine kasta ha la isticmaalee.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Turjumaadaha la doorbido iyo codka luqad kasta waa astaamo Tranzly Pro ah.','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Turjumaadaha la doorbiday (midkiiba hal saf: erey = turjumaad)','Formality'=>'Qaabka rasmiga ah','Default'=>'Caadiga ah','Formal'=>'Rasmiga ah','Informal'=>'Aan rasmi ahayn','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Tilmaamaha qaabka (dhagaystayaasha, codka sumadda)','Save glossary'=>'Kaydi ereayada','Settings'=>'Dejinta','Translation engine'=>'Mashiinka turjumaada','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Waxa Tranzly ku turjumayo boggan','found, translated with your content'=>'la helay, oo lagu turjumay nuxurkaaga','not on this site'=>'ma ahan boggan','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Marka la isticmaalo Tranzly Pro: bogagga Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen iyo WPBakery; wax kasta oo ku jira WooCommerce, oo ay ku jiraan qiimayaasha lacagta booqashada; meelaha SEO ee Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress iyo All in One SEO; goobaha ACF, Meta Box iyo Pods; foomamka iyo iimayladooda; qoraalka mawduucaaga iyo furayaasha (plugins); iyo faallooyinka iyo dib u eegisyada.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Qoraalka dukaanka iyo iimaylada','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Mowduucyada iyo madaxyada iimaylka, magacyada habka lacag-bixinta iyo dhoofinta, iyo ogaysiisyada bixinta. Iimayl kasta oo dalbasho ah wuxuu ku baxayaa luqadda lagu dalbaday.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Foomamka iyo iimayyadooda','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Foom kasta wuxuu hayaa hal liis oo ah gelitaanno; summadaha, badhamada, fariimaha iyo i-maylovlada waxay ka muuqdaan luqadda booqdaha.','Saved.'=>'La kaydiyey.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'Weli lama qeexin wax ACF, Meta Box ama Pods ah.','Field'=>'Goob','Where'=>'Halkee','In a translation'=>'Tarjumaadaha ku jira','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Maxaa ku dhaca %s inta ay socoto turjumaaddu','Translate it'=>'Turjum','Copy it as it is'=>'Sidii uu yahay ugu koobbi','Leave it empty'=>'Iska daa madhan','The shop’s currency'=>'Lacagta dukaanka','Currencies'=>'Lacagaha','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Muuji qiimaha lacagaha kale (lacagta dukaanka ee rasmiga ah waa %s)','Exchange rates'=>'Heerarka sarifka','Rates last updated %s.'=>'Qiimaha waxaa la cusboonaysiiyay %skii ugu dambeeyay.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'Qiimayaasha weli lama soo celin.','Update the rates now'=>'Hadda cusboonaysii qiimaha','New currency'=>'Lacag cusub','Choose…'=>'Dooro…','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Qiime (kiiskiiba %s)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Ku qorista qiime waxay xajineysaa: cusboonaysiinta maalinlaha ahi ma beddeli doonto.','Rounding'=>'Wareegid','None'=>'Ma jiro','Round up'=>'Wareeji','Round to the nearest'=>'Ku wareegi kan ku xiga','Round down'=>'Wareegso hoos','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'U soo koobi (tusaale ahaan 1, 0.05 ama 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Qiimaha wuxuu ku dhamaadaa (tusaale ahaan 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Ku dar lacag','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Waa kuwee booqdayasha arki doona lacagta','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Sida waddanku yahay: summadda dalka ee labada xaraf ka kooban (tusaale ahaan CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'Booqashadayaasha ka imanaya %s','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'U oggolow booqdayeyaasha inay doortaan (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Qiimaha hadda wuxuu ku xiran yahay buskud (cookie) ama dalka booqdayaha: hubi in kaydkaaga boggu uu ku kala duwanaado buskudka "tranzly_currency", ama uu ka reebo bogagga dukaanka.','Save currencies'=>'Kaydiso lacagaha','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Erayada mawduucingaga iyo fiilooyinkaagu ay daabacaan (badhamada, calaamadaha). Akhri mawduuc ama fiilo hal mar, kadibna halkan ku turjumi qoraalkeeda; turjumaadaadu waxay ka adkaan doontaa tan fiilada lafteeda.','%d texts'=>'%d qoraallo','not read yet'=>'weli lama aqrin','Read again'=>'Dib u akhri','Read its text'=>'Akhri qoraalkeeda','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'Shaqadu waxay ku bilaabatay %d turjumaadood oo la qabanayo. Waxay ka socotaa xagga dambe: waad xiri kartaa boggan.','Queued again.'=>'Dib loo safay.','Running'=>'Socota','Finished'=>'Dhameeyay','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Markabka turjumaada ku deji tabta Engines marka hore.','Translate every'=>'Turjum mid kasta','Into'=>'Gudaha','With'=>'La socota','Each language’s own engine'=>'Matoorkii luuqad kastaa','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Daabac turjumaadaha (haddii kale waxaa loo kaydin doonaa sidii qabyo-qoraal ahaan)','Estimate the cost'=>'Qiyaas qiimaha','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'%1$d qoraallo, %2$s xarfaha. Qiimaha mishiinkan hore looma oga.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'%1$d qoraallo, %2$s xarfaha: ku dhawaad $%3$s koontadaada gaarka ah.','Start translating'=>'Bilow tarjumaadda','Jobs'=>'Shaqooyin','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan shaqooyin turjumaad ah.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Shaqada %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d ee ka mid ah %2$d la turjumay, %3$d waa fashilmay, %4$d waa la booday (la ilaaliyay ama horay ugu jiray luqaddaas)','Stop this job'=>'Jooji shaqadan','See what failed and why'=>'Arag waxa guuldarraystay iyo sababta','Content'=>'Tixraac','Language'=>'Luqadda','What went wrong'=>'Wixii khaldamay','Fix it'=>'Hagaaji','Retry with'=>'Ku celceli iyadoo la adeegsanayo','The same engine'=>'Naqshadda isla marka ah','Retry'=>'Isku day mar kale','Translate by hand'=>'Ku turjun gacanta','Menus saved.'=>'Liisaska la keydiyay.','%d texts translated.'=>'%d qoraallo ah ayaa la turjumay.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'La kaydiyay. Sixitaankaaga waa laga ilaaliyaa turjumaada mashiinka.','The same menu, translated'=>'Menu-ga isla markaas ah, ee la turjumay','A separate menu per language'=>'Menu gaar ah luuqad kasta','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Sida caadiga ah menu kasta waa la turjumaa: xiriiriyayaashiisu waxay u horseedaan boggagii la turjumay, oo wata ciwaankooda. Halkan ka dooro menu u gaar ah luqad halkii laga isticmaali lahaa kan caadiga ah.','Shared text'=>'Qoraalka la wadaago','Which text'=>'Waa maxay qoraalku','Menu labels'=>'Calaamadaha liiska','Site title, tagline and widgets'=>'Magaca goobta, halkudhiga iyo wiji-wigyada','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Naqshadaha, madaxyada, gunta iyo qaababka','Translate the missing text'=>'Turjumiqadka maqan','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Halkan ma jiro qoraal la turjumo.','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Qof ayaa saxay, waa la ilaaliyay','Save corrections'=>'Keydso sixitaanka','Languages and settings'=>'Luqadaha iyo dejinta','Engines'=>'Mashiinnada','Translation jobs'=>'Shaqooyinka turjumaada','Addresses and SEO'=>'Ciwaannada iyo SEO','Language switchers'=>'Beddelaha luqadda','SEO audit'=>'SEO xisaabtan','Menus and shared text'=>'Liisaska iyo qoraalka la wadaago','Translation status'=>'Xaaladda turjumaadda','Integrations'=>'Isku-dhafka','No meta description'=>'Ma jiro sharaxaad kooban oo ku saabsan bogga (meta description).','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Noocyada luqadda ee ay booqdayashu aysan furan karin (qabyo, gaar ah ama erayga sirta ah)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Cinwaanku wuxuu weli isticmaalayaa erayadii asalka ahaa','Still holds the original text'=>'Weli waxa ay haysaa qoraalkii asalka ahaa','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Hantishowrka SEO ee luuqadaha badan waa qayb ka mid ah Tranzly Pro. Wuxuu helayaa sharraxaadyada meta ee maqan, hreflang ee jabtay, cinwaannada aan la turjumin iyo nuxurka labanlaabantay, luuqad kasta.','Language to audit'=>'Luqadda la hubinayo','Run the audit'=>'Samee hanti-dhawrka','Check the next pages'=>'Hubi bogagga xiga','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'%1$d bogoc ayaa la hubiyay, %2$d dhibaatooyin ayaa la helay.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'Luqadda oo dhan waa la hubiyay.','Page'=>'Bogga','Problem'=>'Dhibaato','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'Shaqada %1$d waa billowday: %2$d bog ayaa gadaal ka socod ah lagu turjumayaa. Ka soco Shaqooyinka turjumaadda.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'%d tarjumaadaha ayaa lagu hubinayaa asalka. Dhibcaha ayaa ka muuqda halkaan markay yimaadaan.','Missing'=>'Maqan','Out of date'=>'Waqtigii ka dhacay','Translated'=>'La turjumay','Edited by a person'=>'Qof ayaa wax ka beddelay','Machine translated'=>'Turjumidda mashiinka','Waiting for review'=>'Waa la sugayaa in dib-loogesh lagu sameeyo','Needs a human look'=>'Waxay u baahan tahay indho bini\'aadam','Everything'=>'Wax walba','Up to date'=>'Cusubna','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly wuxuu weli soo saarayaa turjumaadaha duugga ah ee dhacay. Tirada "ee dhacday" way kori doontaa inta uu sidaas sameynayo.','Content type'=>'Nooca nuxurka','All content'=>'Dhammaan waxyaabaha ku jira','Average quality'=>'Tayada celcelis ahaan','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'%1$d la turjumay (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Muuji','Translate everything missing'=>'Turjun wax kasta oo maqan','Update everything out of date'=>'Cusbooneysii wax kasta oo dhacay waqtigoodii','Check the quality with AI'=>'Tayada ku hubi AI','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Dib u turjum bogagga dhibcaha hooseeya leh','Nothing here.'=>'Waxba ma yaallo halkan.','Quality'=>'Tayada','by a person'=>'qof uu leeyahay','waiting for review'=>'la sugayo dib u eegis','Show more'=>'Muuji wax badan','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Tarjumo xaddiga weyn ee degelka oo dhan (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Adoo adeegsanaya Tranzly Pro, dooro noocyada iyo luqadaha nuxurka, arag qiyaasta, oo hal mar ku turjun barta oo dhan.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'%d shaqo oo asalka ah ayaa billowday, midkiiba luqad. Kala soco shaqooyinka Turjumaadda.','Content types'=>'Noocyada nuxurka','What to translate'=>'Waxa la tarjumayaa','Only what is missing'=>'Waxa ka dhiman oo keliya','Only what is out of date'=>'Kaliya waxa dhacay waqtigoodii','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Wax kasta (bogagga qofku wax ka beddelay sidooda ayay ahaanayaan)','Estimate'=>'Qiyaas','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'%1$d bogag, %2$s xarfaha. Mashiinkani ma daabaco qiime.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'%1$d bogag, %2$s xarfaha, ku dhowaa $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Raadi qoraal','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'%d kale: ku qor "Raadi qoraal" si aad u yareyso liiska.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Badhan yar oo ku yaal gees kasta oo ka mid ah bog kasta, oo ku saabsan mawduuc kasta, iyada oo aan lahayn habeyn.','Off'=>'Damן','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Geeska hoose, dhinaca dhammaadka','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Geeska hoose, dhinaca billowga','Top corner, end side'=>'Geeska sare, dhinaca dhammaadka','Top corner, start side'=>'Geeska sare, dhinaca billowga','Switcher around the content'=>'Beddelaha ku xeeran waxyaabaha ku jira','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Ku dar badalaha qoraal iyo bog kasta','Before the content'=>'Kahintii wax ku jira','After the content'=>'Intoo ka dambeeya waxa ku jira','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Hababka kale ee lagu daro beddelaha','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Tifaftiraha xannibaadda iyo tifaftiraha bogga: xannibaadda "Beddelaha luqadda" (Language switcher), oo wata shan naqshadood.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: shayga "Language switcher".','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Liiska: Muuqaalka → Liiska → Sanduuqa “Badalaha luqadda”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Qaybaha dhinaca: agabka "Luuqad beddelaha".','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Meelkasta oo kale, calaamadda gaaban:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor iyo Bricks: widgets-ka "Language switcher" ee dhisme kasta.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Widgets-ka Elementor iyo Bricks waxay qayb ka yihiin Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Kaydi','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Hal galka luqad kasta: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Luqad kasta waxaa u gaar ah hal subdomain: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Domain gooni ah luuqad kasta: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Halbeeg su\'aal: example.com/?lang=de (bogagga duugga ah)','Category'=>'Qeybta','Tag'=>'Calaamadii','Product'=>'Badeecad','Product category'=>'Nooca badeecada','Product tag'=>'Astaanta badeecada','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'La kaydiyay. Ciwaanada luqaddaada waa la bedelay sida hoos ka muuqata.','Language in the address'=>'Luqadda cinwaanka','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Sida dadka soo booqday iyo mashiinnada raadinta ay ku gaaraan luqad kasta','Address word for %s'=>'Erayga ciwaanka ee %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Luuqadda caadiga ah ma laha eray ku jira ciwaannadeeda.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Domain-ka loogu talagalay %s (ikhtiyaari)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Markanka hore barta domain-ka ku hagaaji boggan. Luqad aan lahayn domain waxay isticmaashaa galka ku yaal domain-kaaga ugu weyn.','Where each language lives now'=>'Halkay luqad kastaa hadda ku nooshahay','Translated address words'=>'Erayada cinwaanka la turjumay','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Ciwaanada bogagga iyo qoraallada waxay ka yimaadaan cinwaannadooda la turjumay. Halkaan waxaad ku turjumaysaa ereyada go\'an, markaa /de/kategorie/ wuxuu beddelayaa /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (hadda “%2$s”)','Search engines and visitors'=>'Mashiinnada raadinta iyo booqdayaasha','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'U soo bandhig booqashooyinka luuqadooda oo wata calaamad yar (waligoodna ha u leexin dhinaca kale)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Ka qari bogagga aan la turjumin mashiinnada raadinta (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Turjumaad ay ku jirto qoraalkii asalka ahaa waxaa laga reebaa natiijooyinka raadinta ilaa inta la turjumayo.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Qayb ka mid ah Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly waxay ku darsataa xiriirinta hreflang (oo leh x-default), luqadda bogga iyo jihada, iyo luqad kasta sitemap-kaaga:','Working together with: %s.'=>'La shaqaynaya: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Eray kasta oo cinwaan ah waa 2 ilaa 12 xaraf oo yar, nambaro, ama xariijimo gaaban.','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Cusboonaysiin toos ah markaa la cusboonaysiinayo, doorarka dib-u-eegayaasha, dhoofinta XLIFF ee turjubaanada, ka beddelashada WPML, Polylang ama TranslatePress iyo hubinta tayada AI waxay la socdaan Tranzly Pro.','When an original changes'=>'Markii uu asalku isbeddelo','When a page is edited'=>'Marka bogga la tarto','Mark its translations out of date'=>'Calaamadi turjumaadaha inaysan cusbooneysnayn','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Turjum tarjumaadaha mar labaad asalka dambe','Do nothing'=>'Waxba ha qaban','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'Turjumaad ay qof ahi wax ka beddelay marnaba lama dul qoro; halkaas waxaa loo calaamadiyaa mid dhacay.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'Turjum bogocyada cusub luqad kasta markii la daabaco','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Qaab kale oo AI ah ayaa akhriya turjumaad kasta oo la socota asalkeeda, wuu qiimeeyaa oo wuxuu magacaabaa khaladaadka. Waxay isticmaashaa furahaaga gaarka ah ee AI ee ka yimid habaynta AI. Ka bilow hubinta xaaladda Turjumaadda.','AI provider'=>'Bixiyaha AI','The AI settings’ general model'=>'Qaabka guud ee dejinta AI','Recommended'=>'La soo jeediyay','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Boggu wuxuu u baahan yahay eegmo bini\'aadam ah dhibcahaas hoostooda','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Daabac kaliya turjumaadaha uu dib-u-eegayaashu ansixiyay','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Sii dadka doorka Turjubaanka (wuxuu wax ka beddelaa turjumaadaha, marnaba asalka ma taabto, ma daabici karo) ama doorka Dib-u-eegaha turjumaada (sidoo kale wuu ansixiyaa). Dib-u-eegayaashu waxay sidoo kale helayaan wax kasta oo sugaya ee ku jira liiska Qoraallada iyo Bogagga ee hoos yimaada "La sugayo"; daabacaadda mid ka mid ah halkaas waxay ansixinaysaa.','Manage users'=>'Maamul isticmaalayaasha','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Wax a sugaya dib u eegis ma jiraan.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Fiiro gaar ah oo ku socota turjubaanka (ikhtiyaari ah)','Read side by side'=>'Akhri iyadoo dhinac la iska saaray','Approve'=>'Ansanax Runta / Ogolow','Ask for changes'=>'Codso isbeddelo','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'%d turjubaan ayaa la keenay oo laga ilaaliyay turjumaada mashiinka.','Export and import for translators'=>'Dhoofinta iyo soo dejinta turjubaannada','Not translated yet'=>'Weli aan la turjumin','Already translated'=>'Horay loo turjumay','Format'=>'Qaabayn','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (qalabka turjumaada)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (faaf-faahiyeyaasha)','Download the file'=>'So degso faylka','Import a translated file'=>'Sooji geli fayl la turjumay','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'Lama sameyn: %1$d xiriirin waa la saaray, %2$d bogag la soo dejiyay waa la tirtiray.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Tijaabo qalad la\'aan ah, waxba la bedelin:','Imported:'=>'La keenay:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'%1$d luqadood oo lagu daray, %2$d turjumaadood oo la xiriiriyay, %3$d bogag ah oo la dhisay, %4$d qoraallo ah.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Markabka kale dami marka hore (ciwaannada iyo beddelayaasheedu waxay iska hor imanayaan Tranzly). Xogtiisu waxay ku jirtaa halkii ay joogtay, markaa waad dib u beddeli kartaa; Undo waxay si sax ah uga saartaa waxa soo dejintu ku dartay.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Ma jiro wax xog ah oo ka imanaya furahan (plugin) ee ku yaal boggan.','Languages: %s'=>'Luqadaha: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'wali waa shaqaynaysaa: marka hore dami.','Dry run'=>'Tijaabada qallajiska ah','Import'=>'Keenso','Undo the import'=>'Ka noqo soo dejinta','Comments and product reviews'=>'Faallooyinka iyo dib u eegisyada badeecada','Each language keeps its own'=>'Luqad kastaa waxay haysataa midkeeda','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Muuji faallooyinka luqad kasta ee nooc kasta','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Muuji dhammaantood, iyadoo loo turjumay luqadda akhristaha','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Turjumiddu waxay isticmaashaa mashiinka turjumaadda ee aad dooratay faallo kasta oo la ansixiyay. Spam-ka iyo faallooyinka sugaya dib-u-eegista marnaba lama diro.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'La kaydiyay. Qaybaha aad bedeshay waxaa loo calaamadiyay inay yihiin kuwo uu qof hubiyay, tarjumaddanina waa laga ilaaliyaa turjumaadda mashiinka.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'Qaabka turjumaaddan ayaa lagaga beddelay tifaftiraha, markaa qaybo ka mid ah mar dambe lama lamaaneenayaan asalka. Qaybaha aan lahayn lammaane waxaa lagu muujiyey iyagoo maran; ka beddel inta hartay tifaftiraha.','Open the editor'=>'Fur tafatiraha','Original (%s)'=>'Asalka ah (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Turjumaad (%s)','Save changes'=>'Keymo isbeddellada','Open in the editor'=>'Ka fur tifaftiraha','Checked by a person'=>'Qof baa hubiyay','Imported'=>'La soo dhoofiyay','Not in the translation'=>'Laguma jiro turjumaadda','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ku dar luqad labaad hoos yimaada Tranzly oo ku taal menu-ga maamulka, beddelaha ayaana halkan ka muuqan doona.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Way ku xiran yahay asal ahaan: calanka waa waddan, ee ma aha luqad.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Waxa ay akhristayaasha shaashaduhu ku dhawaaqaan, tusaale ahaan “Dooro luqad”.','Colours'=>'Midabada','Not translated'=>'A aan turjumin','Original'=>'Asalka','Published'=>'La daabacay','Draft'=>'Qabyo','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Qof ayaa hubiyay, waa la ilaaliyay','Imported, protected'=>'La soo dejiyay, waa la ilaalinayaa','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Weli lama turjumin (koobiy)','View'=>'Eeg','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Fur si loogu turjumi karo mar kale','Protect'=>'Ilaali','Publish the translations'=>'Daabac turjumaadaha','Translate into %d language'=>'U tur %d luqad' . "\0" . 'U turjumin %d luqadood','Show this block'=>'Muuji balooggan','In every language'=>'Luqad kasta','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Kaliya luuqadaha la calaamadiyay','In every language except those ticked'=>'Dhammaan luqadaha marka laga reebo kuwa la saxaaqay','Image per language'=>'Sawirka luqad kasta','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'U muuji sawir kale akhristayaasha luuqad, tusaale ahaan boodh ay ku qoran yihiin erayo.','Replace the %s image'=>'Beddel sawirka %s','Choose a %s image'=>'Dooro sawir %s ah','Use the original image'=>'Isticmaal sawirka asalka ah','Correct this translation'=>'Sax turjumaaddan','Saving…'=>'Kaydinta…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Qoraalka la turjumay. Riix Geliso si aad u saxdo.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Guji qoraal kasta oo xuduudaysan si aad u saxdo turjumaaddeeda.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'Lama helin wax qoraal ah oo la turjumay oo ku yaal boggan si looga tahrifiyo halkan. Isticmaal tifaftiraha dhinac-ka-dhinac ah halkii.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Beddelaha luqadda','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Xiriirinta boggan ee luqad kasta oo ka mid ah luqadaha mareegta. Ma soo bandhigto wax ilaa inta laba luqadood ama ka badan la liis gareeyo.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Luqadda','block keywordswitcher'=>'beddelaha','block keywordtranslation'=>'turjumid','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'U oggolaado dadka soo booqday inay boggan ku akhriyaan luqadahaaga kale: liis, kaniiniyada, badhamada, liiska la soo dejiyo ama koodhadhka luqadda, oo ay la socdaan calamo ikhtiyaari ah.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'luqadaha badan']];